#--- 14. УНИКИ (всегда; SSF — каждый потенциальный сайдгард) ---------------------------------------------------------
#--- 14а. TOP-BESTSELLER UNIQUES (crutch: only div-money uniques highlighted.
#   Bases by poe2db + poeshop: Temporalis(Silk Robe) ~8-10.5k div | Mageblood(Utility Belt) ~220 div |
#   Headhunter(Heavy Belt) ~33 div | Morior Invictus(Grand Regalia) ~30 div. Runemastered = same base.
Show
	Rarity Unique
	BaseType == "Silk Robe"
	SetFontSize 28
	SetTextColor 255 255 255 255
	SetBorderColor 255 255 0 255
	SetBackgroundColor 200 0 0 255
	PlayAlertSound 5 300
	PlayEffect Yellow
	MinimapIcon 0 Yellow Star

